    <briefdescription>
<para>Unified gateway for topic forwarding. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The gateway handles both:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Explicit topics - configured with specific downsample ratios</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Auto-discovered topics - found via ROS graph introspection</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Message types are always auto-discovered, eliminating the need for manual type specification in config. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
